.git
.gitignore
.github

# Anchored patterns only match the root, and these live one level down. Without
# the glob the local virtualenv is copied into the image next to the one the
# build just made.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage
**/dist
**/.vite
*.py[cod]

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

data/uploads
models/*.joblib
infra/terraform
plans
docs/assets
*.md
!README.md
.DS_Store
